Common Interview Mistakes

❌ Saying CNAME can be used for the root domain.

❌ Confusing Alias Records with A Records.

❌ Forgetting that Route 53 routing decisions are based on DNS resolution, not per HTTP request.

❌ Assuming health checks automatically restart failed EC2 instances (they don't—they only influence DNS responses).

❌ Mixing up Geolocation and Latency-Based Routing.

